window.products.push({"id":393005,"name":"Skullis 2.0\" Colorful Tiger Iron Eye Crystal Skull, Hand Carved Gemstone Fine Art Sculpture, Reiki Healing Stone Statue.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613D42YOLyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The picture is a sample piece. Due to stones' natural characteristics. We will select one from a group ship to you by random. What you receive may be of some difference to this one. Each one is unique. And we guarantee all are of same quality. Beautifully Carved Fine Art: Natural gemstone sculpted with our exclusive Realistic crystal skull design (South Africa Tiger Iron Eye). A Breathtaking Display: Ideal for display on any mantel, table or shelf, this crystal skull brings elegance, style, and sophistication to your home and office. For Healing and Inspiration: Often used to enhance meditation, inspiration, and the healing properties of natural gems and minerals, our Fine Art crystal skull is comfortable to hold and may help to you to cultivate peace, relaxation, and quiet. Size: 2.0\"x1.3\"x1.5\" (50x32x37 mm); Weight: 3.5OZ (98g).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613D42YOLyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skullis","source_asin":"B07ZLYHRST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZLYHRST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZLYHRST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393006,"name":"BestGK Double-Probe Meat Thermometer, 2s Instant Read Waterproof Digital Thermometer with Alarm Function and Calibration Function for Cooking, Beef, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KVHzOCBAL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why do you need a meat thermometer? Using a meat thermometer when cooking is one way to help ensure a delicious outcome with little effort. The best ones allow you to quickly and easily monitor the internal temperature so you can avoid overcooking and serving dried-out food. The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) recommends cooking foods thoroughly and checking them using a meat thermometer to avoid nasty foodborne illnesses like Salmonella or norovirus. The recommendations for safe meat temperatures: Beef, pork, veal, and lamb: 145°FGround meats: 160°FFully cooked ham: Reheat to 140°FUncooked ham: 165°FPoultry: 165°FFish & shellfish: 145°F Feature: Double Probes: A rotational probe for meat, wire probe for grill Calibrate Function: Can be re-calibrated at 0°c or 32°F Alarm Function: Support the set temperature, when the meat reaches the required temperature, an alarm will be issued Meat Selection Function: different temperatures can be set according to different meats. Specification: Temperature Range: -50℃to 300℃ (-58℉to572℉) Accuracy Range: +/-1℃(-2℉) at-20℃to200℃(-4℉to392℉) Probe Material: Food grade 304 stainless steel probe Rotational Probe: 5.11in Long Wire Probe: 6.4 in Probe Wire: 45 in Use Battery: CR2450 3V button battery, works to 500h Weight: 0.19 lbs Size: 6.5*1.6*0.7 in Warnings: 1, Do not touch hot probe with bare hands.2, Wash the metal probe in soapy water.3, Clean the thermometer with a wet cloth.4, Do not leave the thermometer in the oven while cooking.5, Sterilize the metal probe by inserting it into boiling water for several minutes. Package: 1 x Meat Thermometer2 x Probes1 x CR2450 Battery1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KVHzOCBAL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestGK","source_asin":"B08L6F8ZPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L6F8ZPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L6F8ZPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
