window.products.push({"id":393045,"name":"Touchless Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser with Adjustable Output of Liquid Flow Design Infrared Sensor, Automatic Hand Free Soap Dispenser for Bathroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Enjoy ultimate convenience and hygiene with our upgraded automatic soap dispenser. ✔Touchless & Hands-Free With an upgraded infrared motion sensor, the fully automatic touch-free operation soap dispenser helps to avoid cross-infection. ✔ High-quality ABS material This automatic soap dispenser is made of ABS + PC and plastic. The dish soap dispenser feels very comfortable to the touch and the silver appearance is very textured. ✔3 Optional Soap Volume Control The automatic soap dispensers variable dispenses control soap volume by adjusting the switch to control the liquid volume from 0.5 to 3ml. ✔Non-Drip Spout, No Tail, No Waste Different from another manual soap dispenser, this touchless soap dispenser cuts off the liquid soap completely. No dripping or trailing, no waste soap. ✔IPX4 Waterproof, Leak-Proof & Non-Slip Design This touchless soap dispenser is IPX4 waterproof, designed with a waterproof base and rubber seals to prevent the battery compartment from getting soaked in water. ✔Support various detergent This automatic soap dispenser touchless is compatible with most kinds of liquid, such as dish soap, hand sanitizer, shampoo, shower gel, etc.  ✋ Specifications Capacity: 9.88oz / 280ml Dimensions: 7.68 x 3.9 x 3.5 inches Sensor range: 5-7cm Battery-Operated: 4*AA (not included) 👋 Important Note: 👐When using this hand-free soap dispenser in a strong light environment may cause Infrared sensors to malfunction. 👐If the soap is too thick, the automatic soap dispenser may not produce liquid, just add a small amount of water and stir. 👐if there is some moisture in the new kitchen soap dispenser, it is left over from testing the product, not old or second-hand. 👐The first time you use our hand soap dispenser, you need to sense the automatic soap dispenser 2 or 3 times to fill the straw with soap 👐When the liquid level is low, please add liquid. Otherwise, the touchless soap dispenser will not pump out any liquid. 👐When the light is flashing, it means the battery is low. Please change the batteries. 👐If the automatic soap dispenser cannot dispense the soap properly, please poke the nozzle of the auto soap dispenser by hand, so that the internal straw can contact the air to dispense the soap 👐After being used for a long time, if the automatic soap dispenser suddenly stopped working, Please check: 👐Check the batteries, and check the motor and infrared sensor are working. 👐Check the smart infra-red motion sensors keep clean, and check the holes in the cover are not blocked by soap 👐Check if maybe soap is too thick, the dish soap dispenser would get blocked up. please take it apart and clean the tubes and openings, and then confirm that it works properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Graefsty","source_asin":"B0BB6FX3WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB6FX3WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB6FX3WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
