window.products.push({"id":393093,"name":"Truweigh Vortex Digital Bowl Scale - (2000g x 0.1g - Black) - Digital Kitchen Scale - Food Scale with Bowl - Baking Scale Digital Grams and Ounces - K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Blg1C2d1L._SL1472_.jpg","description":"Truweigh is a leader in the kitchen food scale industry, with a wide range in scales for every market, we have a pocket scale to fit every need. The VORTEX bowl scale 2000g x 0.1g is known for its large weighing bowl making this a top of the line meal prep scale. All Truweigh food weight scales come with a 10 year limited warranty protecting your purchase. The VORTEX digital bowl scale features a compact, circular design and dishwasher-safe weighing bowl for a plethora of kitchen and home uses. The weighing bowl stores over the scale when not in use and protects the weighing platform. The bowl has a large volume for weighing, but the compact design of the scale makes it easy to store without being an eyesore on your counter. Results are easy to read on the white, back-lit LCD in any lighting condition. Our Truweigh VORTEX food scale with bowl ships to you pre-calibrated but we suggest purchasing one of our calibration weights to keep your measurements accurate over time. Our portable scale comes with built-in overload protection to help prevent long term damage to your powder scale. The VORTEX digital gram scale is the perfect addition to any DIY craft station, soap making supplies, or your candle making kit! Our portable food scale convert automatically between: G / OZ / OZT / DWT / CT/ GN The Truweigh VORTEX scale for meal prep has a max capacity of 2000g and a readability of 0.1g making this a great scale for baking bread. It also comes with our in-depth instruction manual to make sure you utilize all features that come with our Truweigh VORTEX herb scale. Our digital food scale has a round weighing platform that the included bowl fits snug to. Truweigh also included two AA batteries, making our baking scale ready to use as soon as you receive it. The Truweigh VORTEX digital weight scale crosses over as the most versatile counter top scale on the market. It can be used as a scale for packages, reloading equipment, soap making supplies, scale for food, travel scale, resin scale for DIY projects, meat scale, gold scale, and so much more. With impeccable accuracy trust in Truweigh to help make sure your next meal or at home DIY project is finished with precision and accurate weights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Blg1C2d1L._SL1472_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Truweigh","source_asin":"B073YHXQRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073YHXQRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073YHXQRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
