window.products.push({"id":393107,"name":"COSTWAY Oil Filled Radiator Heater, 700W Portable Space Heater with Adjustable Thermostat, Overheat Protection, Electric Heater for Bedroom, Indoor us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpunq6QIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"☀️ 【Adjustable Thermostat】In order to meet your different heating needs, this oil filled radiator heater allows you to adjust the temperature from low to high (32℉ - 194℉) by rotating the thermostat knob. Besides, it features the thermostat. If the room reaches the desired temperature, it will auto-off for energy-saving. ☀️【Effective Heating】Equipped with 7 heating fins and diathermic oil that no need to refill, this electric space heater is able to heat up small spaces evenly. Meanwhile, the 360 full-area heat dissipation provides comfy and steady warmth for people around it. ☀️ 【Designed for Safety】Considering your security, this portable radiator heater comes with overheat and tip-over protection. If it overheats or accidentally dumps, this space heater will automatically shut off for safe protection. At the same time, the ETL certification adds extra safety. ☀️ 【Quiet Operation】Working without any fans and winds, this electric oil filled radiator creates a noiseless environment for you to work. Likewise, there are no dazzling lights that avoid disturbing your sleeping. Therefore, you can use this space oil filled heater day and night. ☀️ 【Portable Space Heater】With the handy handle and lightweight design, this oil filled radiator electric heater makes movement conveniently so that you can move it from one room to another effortlessly. In addition, the compact size is perfect for different places, such as home, apartment and office etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpunq6QIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B076J929TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076J929TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076J929TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393108,"name":"Unique Crystal Champagne Flutes Glass, Hand Blown Wedding Champagne Glasses Set of 2-Elegant Gift for Anniversary,Birthday,Parties-5 oz,Crystal Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615ecP0aprL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","description":"0.8mm ULTRA-THIN RIM: ROVSYA champagne flutes are hand crafted with thousand-year-old craftsmanship techniques and every glass is generally LIGHTWEIGHT,THINNER and more ELEGANT than machine-made ones. 0.8mm rim doesn't allow the glass to disturb the palate and preserves the delicateness of the sparkling wine and you will feel our champagne flute is so thin when tasting, nothing will come between you and your champagne! SPARKLING LEAD-FREE CRYSTAL:With the most skilled craftsmen and the best raw materials ROVSYA has always strived for perfection. By eliminating lead content from the crystal glass composition,our glasses replaced with fine TITANIUM CRYSTAL and a patented chemical formulation that produces ultra clear, pure and bright champagne flutes. Combined the most exquisite craftsmanship with the best crystal, ROVSYA glasses as LIGHT as feathers and SHINNY like star. V SHAPE FLUTE DESIGN: The gorgeous thin and super clear champagne glass is the not only GORGEOUS, tall and elegant, but you capture all the flavors of any champagne, especially your high end champagne.You can see it has a tapering base, an ideal shape for giving rise to a singular stream of bubbles. LUXURIOUS EXQUISITE PACKAING: From the moment you pick ROVSYA Crystal Champagne Flutes, you would definitely be impressed by the luxurious packaging with champagne bow and elegant glass.Our beautifully created gift packaging allow your beautiful glasses always arrive in one piece and can be used for storage.These unparalleled wine glasses make for a PERFECT GIFT given the option to CHAMPAGNE LOVERS. PERFEXT HANDMADE ARTWORK: ROVSYA glasses are a lifetime investment in improved and enriched wine experience. We all know that crystal glass will broken if it is knocked.You can see that the rim and wall of our glass is very THIN and CLEAR, but also fragile. Although the lose of broken is huge for us, we still insist on HANDMAKING only, hoping to bring WINE LOVERS a perfect champagne tasting experience. If you receive broken, please contact us and we will provide you with help for 90 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615ecP0aprL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UDISON","source_asin":"B08PCQ5QTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCQ5QTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PCQ5QTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
