window.products.push({"id":393235,"name":"Wildkin Kids Canvas Sling Bookshelf with Storage for Boys and Girls, Wooden Design Features Four Shelves and Two Drawers, Helps Keep Bedrooms, Playroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":77.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Ip3eC+9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DISCOVER WILDKIN’S UNIQUE COLLECTIONSWildkin is a privately owned business located in Nashville Tennessee. We offer fantastic backpacks, lunch boxes, sleeping bags, bedding and more for all ages! Your kids will love our designs and you'll love our quality and pricing! We make useful fun safe gear for kids of all ages and our colorful bags and other items are designed to be both super-safe and very useful. We offer excellent quality non-toxic products With our coordinating accessories you can mix and match our high-quality and unique boys comforter sets girls comforter sets kids sheet sets kids pillows. Coordinating to our kids bedding are clocks lamps and rugs Not only does Wildkin offer the finest in fun kids bedding but also a full line of kids gear including sleeping bags backpacks and lunch bags Wildkin bedding gear and room decor offer the best in quality at a reasonable priceOUR PRODUCTAdd Wildkin’s sling bookshelf for kids with Storage to any room to help children of all ages maintain and organize items in their play space. The convenient and easy design makes this bookshelf for kids the perfect gift for young readers in your life. Measuring 24.4 x 12 x 27.5 inches, Wildkin’s Sling bookshelf for kids bedroom is small enough to fit anywhere in your home, yet large enough to house all your favorite books, magazines, paintings, and more. Each bookshelf for kids bedroom girls and boys features five sling shelves and two bottom pull out drawers, complete with handles. Your child will love that their bookshelf gives them a variety of storage options. This sling bookshelf is also an excellent gift idea for any event like Friendship Day, Independence Day, Mother's Day, Grandparent's Day, Parent's Day, New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas Day. Great presents not only for little ones but for people of all ages as well.PRODUCT CARE INSTRUCTIONSWildkin’s Wildkin Kids small bookshelf are designed specifically for big kids, little kids, and toddlers. With proper care, our Wildkin kid bookshelf will last a long time. When this bookshelf gets messy, Once a week, wipe the top and sides of the bookcase with a microfiber cloth. Using a fresh cloth, dust the tops and spines of the books and the part of the shelves that stick out beyond the books. For the tough stain, use wet microfiber cleaning cloth with mild soap cleaner.90 DAYS WARRANTY AGAINST DEFECTSWe aim for a happy customer experience! All of our products feature a 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are lead-safe, bpa-free, phthalate-free, and conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Ip3eC+9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B08LNBWKX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LNBWKX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LNBWKX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
