window.products.push({"id":393276,"name":"Cristal D'Arques Longchamp 11-3/4-Ounce Crystal Iced-Tea Glass, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRP0WNWML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description America's Favorite Crystal collection¿.Longchamps has graced more tables than any other Crystal pattern, and hes been featured in Films, television programs and print media over and over since its introduction 40 years ago! Longchamp is made from pure, 24% Full Lead crystal exclusively by Cristal dArques, Paris, in its own facility in France. Amazon.com Enjoy a refreshing iced tea or lemonade on a hot day with this handsome lead crystal iced tea glass. Holding a generous 11-3/4-ounces, the glass stands 7-1/8-inches tall and has a diameter of just under 3-inches; it narrows slightly at its midpoint to create an arresting visual appeal. The short stem includes a prismatic ball that furthers the fun of the design elements. Always a classic, you'll be sure to keep the glass for years and years. The Cristal D'Arques Longchamp collection adds a celebratory air to any occasion. It's always the right choice for special moments when only crystal is appropriate. It's also great for giving an added emphasis to less formal events. Designed and made in France, the pattern is made of 24 percent full lead crystal and includes deep, diamond-shaped bevels that capture and refract light at interesting angles. Cristal D'Arques Longchamp was introduced more than 40 years ago, and so includes many accessories; buy this iced tea glass to begin a collection or to add to an already existing one. If given proper care, it's durable enough to stand up to years of use. If washing in a dishwasher, use a liquid or gel detergent suitable for decorated or delicate items and wash on a gentle cycle. If hand washing, use lukewarm, soapy water and a soft sponge and dry with a soft cloth. --Jeff Dalto","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRP0WNWML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arc International","source_asin":"B00099PGR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00099PGR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00099PGR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393277,"name":"Iwell Mid-Century Modern TV Stand for 55 Inch TV, Entertainment Center TV Console with 2 Storage Cabinet and Shelves, TV Stand for Living Room/Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61op7bHzzdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎧Exactly What You Are looking for: Not just a TV cabinet with storage space, but also an attractive craft in your living room or bedroom. Natural wood grain and farmhouse finish creates a warm and inviting vibe, which allows this TV stand to complements easily with various home style. Whether you are in a dorm room, apartment or house, this TV cabinet can add novelties and charm to your house and make your home feel more like home. 🎧Designed for Media Storage: Spacious tabletop make it can accommodate most flat screen and curved TVs up to 55 inches.The open shelves give you spots to display DVD players and media box, while 2 side cabinet(12.8\"W x15.7\"Dx11.4\"H) with door lend even extra space to stash your collection of entertainment accessories and keep your secrets. 🎧Cable Management: Are messy cables an eyesore around your entertainment center? The cable holes on the back keep all the cords of your audio, video, and gaming components be placed in order and out of sight—all you need to do is start the entertainment. 🎧Durable TV Console Table: Skeptical about the sturdiness and stability of this mid century TV stand? Don't worry! Although legs of this table are tapered and slender, enough stable and sturdy as they are made of solid wood(weight capacity up to 150 pounds), While extra mid-leg further enhance the stability and weight-bearing capacity of the entertainment center, with 100% No Wobble. So you can use it for years to come. 🎧Easy to Put Together: Assembly needed? Yes, but don't worry. Entertainment center comes with easy-to-follow picture instructions and numbered parts, just need 30 minutes, you will finish the assembly and get a pretty but practical TV stand( Due tabletop is larger, it is recommended that two people assemble it). 👍100% Satisfaction: Strengthened the package box are used to better protect the TV console cabinet from breaking. In addition, We provide also18 months' Free Warranty, don't worry about receive a defective product or missing parts, We will provide replacements without extra fees and return. Size: 47.2\"L*15.4\"W*19.7\"H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61op7bHzzdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iwell","source_asin":"B09JLLTWBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLLTWBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLLTWBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
