window.products.push({"id":393369,"name":"Homestead Textiles Growers Collection 100-Percent Zero-Twist Pima Cotton 6-Piece Bath Towel Set, Latte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uKgySas+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Homestead Textiles Growers Collection PimaZero-Twist Cotton Ultra Soft 6-Piece Bath Towel Set. Considered the most superior quality towels on the market, Homestead Textiles Pimazero-twist cotton heavyweight towels are at the pinnacle of comfort and luxury. Pimacotton is woven from (ELS) X-Long Staple cotton that is remarkably soft and smooth yet up to 50-percent stronger and more durable than other cotton varieties. Because of its fineness; more fibers can be spun into a yarn of a given count, creating a very thick, dense, durable and absorbent fabric that becomes softer after each wash. Even though Pimacotton towels are promoted as the best quality towels on the market, the price tag does not reflect this considering they will last longer and provide more years of luxurious use. Homestead Textiles's Cooperative of American Cotton Farmers has constructed the Grower's Collection 6-piece towel set from hand selected, 100-percent U.S. grown cotton that has been woven into super soft Pimacotton loops using Zero-Twist technology. The benefit to you is these zero-twist towels allow the cotton fiber to remain hollow, making the towels softer, more absorbent, more durable and less prone to shrinking or pilling. They also retain color better, even after repeated washings. A functional and decorative Fold-Over edge is added to finish off an already perfect towel. Set includes two generously sized 30 by 56-inch bath towels for wrap around comfort, two 16 by 30-inch hand towels and two 13 by 13-inch washcloths. Coordinating 4-Piece Bath Towel Set, 2-Piece bath Towel Set, 2-piece Oversized Bath Sheets/Towel Set, 2-Piece Bath Mats and 3-Piece Sets also available through Amazon. Machine wash warm, tumble-dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uKgySas+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homestead Textiles, Inc.","source_asin":"B004FTOTUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004FTOTUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004FTOTUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
