window.products.push({"id":393390,"name":"Maibet Garment Steamer 120ML Portable Handheld Clothes Steamer Fast Heat-Up Fabric Steamers for Linen Shirts Bedding Suits Curtains When at Home or Tr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51J0utEpm6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you have trouble removing wrinkles from your clothes at home or during your business trip? Now Maibet garment steamer will be the solution and friend for you! Always help you keep neat and fresh when at home or on your travel ! Main Features: -- Easy to handle-- Eliminates wrinkles fast-- For use on clothes, and other fabric surfaces-- Automatic safety shutoff-- Provides 12 minutes of continuous steam on a full tank How to Operate: 1. Unscrew the nozzle head, Fill the tank with water to the desired level. never surpass the maximum level. When you finish filling ,lock the head back on.2. Turn the ON/OFF switch to the ON position, The switch light indicates the steamer is on. Steamer will emit steam from nozzle in 2 minutes.3. Your Travel Garment Steamer has a resetting function. When the unit run out of water, it will reset automatically to ensure your safety while leaving the indicator light ON.4. When you are finished with your steaming session place the ON/OFF switch in the OFF position and remove the plug from the outlet. You will get : 1*Maibet Garment Steamer1*Travel Pouch1*User Manual Notes & Caution 1. Only fill the tank with cold water, do not use hot water. Distilled water is recommend.2. Never turn the unit upside down. Your Travel Garment Steamer should never be tilted past a 60-degree angle especially when the unit is ON3. Close supervision is necessary for any appliance being used by or near children. Do not leave appliance unattended while connected4. Never point the steamer at children or pets, portable garment steamer is not a toy, unplug the cord when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51J0utEpm6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maibet","source_asin":"B073QPKZQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073QPKZQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073QPKZQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
