window.products.push({"id":393618,"name":"Travel Utensils Set with Case, pekifaves Stainless Steel Camping Utensils Service for 1, 8pcs Reusable Portable Utensils Set for Lunch Workplace Campi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817M5P4vYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTH AND ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION- This travel silverware set with case is made of high-quality food-grade stainless steel, reusable and durable for daily use. Easy to clean, the dishwasher safe. UNIQUE AND ELEGANT DESIGN- The travel flatware comes with a delicate floral pattern engraved with laser technology. elegant look and stylish design handle with smooth mirror polished edges, no rough spots, and sharp table knife to cut food more efficiently THE TRAVEL CUTLERY SET INCLUDE- Carrying case, full-size dinner knife, fork, spoon, chopsticks, cleaning brush, silicone straw (more comfortable when using a straw) EASY TO CARRY- This reusable portable cutlery set is small and lightweight. The 8-piece lunch utensils set is a must-have for everyday use. Ideal for travel, work, school, flying, workplace, dining out, picnics, camping, etc. MEANING OF THE PATTERN- Rose represents beauty, love, and hope. The vine goes upward to chase the sunshine and moves closer to a better future every day. We hope that those who use this set will be surrounded by love and hope every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817M5P4vYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"pekifaves","source_asin":"B09KRKS27W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRKS27W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRKS27W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393619,"name":"Crow Canyon Enamelware Round Dinner Salad Serving Plates, Classic Tableware - Set of 4 - Black Marble, 10.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81USCfKMlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish, Sustainable, & Functional Tableware. Entertain guests and feast on a delicious meal with durable, vintage dinner plates from Crow Canyon Home! Measuring 10.25\", each plate is perfect for dining on generous portions of all your home cooked favorites. From chic wedding tableware to everyday usage and camping adventures, this piece of Crow Canyon Home enamelware is both durable and versatile. It’s lightweight and shatterproof, making it great for kids and use in the outdoors. Each item is easy to clean and entirely food safe, even when chipped, so you can enjoy it for years to come. Handmade with a Commitment to Traditional Standards of Quality. Each piece of Crow Canyon Home enamelware is tested by an independent laboratory to meet both FDA and California Food Safety regulations. Everything is handmade in Asia using a meticulous process to ensure the best possible quality. Traditionally created using extremely high heat, each piece of enamelware begins by fusing porcelain onto a steel base and hand-dipping it multiple times, making it safe for the oven and most heat sources (excluding the microwave). The unique marble pattern on the splatterware model is then splattered across the piece by flicking a special brush over it, making each piece a one-of-a-kind treasure. Care & Use Instructions: All Crow Canyon Home Enamelware is dishwasher safe and okay to use on a grill, stovetop, campfire, or in an oven. Enamelware is NOT intended for microwave use. Avoid using abrasive cleansers or hard water stain removers on its surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81USCfKMlcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crow Canyon Home","source_asin":"B074SYF5JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074SYF5JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074SYF5JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393620,"name":"If You Need Me I'll Be - 12oz wine tumbler with Lid - 100% Stainless Steel - Insulated Stemless Double Wall Vacuum Tumbler - Fancy Sayings - Mom Dad W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HsOLP+TBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Your Party, Home or Travel Moments Unforgettable With Your Favorite Drink At Hand! Are you tired of CHEAP AND BORING LOOKING tumblers leaving your water, wine or beer warmish or shattered into 100 pieces wine or champagne glasses?  Look no Further!  PHINEFINDS 12 oz stainless steel insulated wine tumblers are the answer to durable, fancy unique design, unbreakable drinkware solution for your home, office and outdoors Get Your Hands On Our 12oz stainless steel wine tumbler with lid That ATTRACTS ATTENTION! TECHNOLOGY The double wall technology reduces condensation and will not stain tables and counter-tops. Powder Coated Finish protects against chips and scratches 2X HEAT and COLD RESISTANT Copper vacuum insulation allows you to keep your drinks colder and hotter longer than the average cup BPA FREE A wine tumbler with lid made from 304 food grade 100% stainless steel is durable and lightweight. No toxic chemicals and the possibility of deprivation SIZE and USE The perfect size of a 12 oz tumbler is easy to hold. Use this wine tumbler anywhere for any occasion that suits your interests. Ideal to use in pools, hot tubs, beach, camping, picnics or anywhere else outdoors. Hand Wash Recommended UNIQUE GIFTS Bright colors, fancy design, fantastic looks, is wonderful gifts for women and men, family, friends, colleagues Get Your Unique Wine Tumbler Today Risk Free NOW! Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler with Lid, set of Straw with Silicone Tip and Cleaning Brush  Capacity: 12 oz Height: 4.6\" Diameter: 3.51\" Weight: 0.4 lb  Material: 18/8 304 Food Grade Stainless Steel   Package include:  1 x wine tumbler with lid  1 x straw  1 x silicone tip  1 x straw brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HsOLP+TBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PhineFinds","source_asin":"B07KV9DWWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KV9DWWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KV9DWWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
