window.products.push({"id":393622,"name":"Simplay3 Play Around Wiggle Chairs 2-Pack, Kids Wobble Stools for Improved Focus and Attention - Blue, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ul6rWo4LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DEVELOPMENTAL – This kids wobble stool was designed to help busy bodies stay calm and focused while encouraging proper posture and strong core muscles. Rounded, smooth cushion style seat with molded in sensory dots for a steady grip, is also beneficial for ADD, ADHD, and Autism. TIP RESISTANT – Kids wobble chair features a specialized base that allows kids to continuously move around while maintaining focus on other activities. THE RIGHT FIT - – Wiggle chairs come in two sizes: 12” high for ages 3-6; 14” high for ages 5-8. DURABLE DESIGN – Heavy-duty, 1-piece plastic construction is lightweight and easy for kids to move. AMERICAN MADE – Plastic wobble stools are made and designed in the USA and require no assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ul6rWo4LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simplay3","source_asin":"B08F65MJRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F65MJRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F65MJRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393623,"name":"Lantoo Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser, Hands free Automatic Dish Foam Soap Dispenser Touchless for Bathroom & Kitchen, 280ml Capacity, Adjustable Vo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HCViaHrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of cheap, glass dispenser bottles that get damaged after the first drop? Tired of traditional dispenser which needs to push out or pour out the liquid soap or hand sanitiser? Want a modern stylish automatic soap dispenser in your bathroom, kitchen, and office? Do your kids hate to wash hands? Do you want to encourage him/her to form a habit of washing hands? Then this Lantoo automatic soap dispenser is the one you need! How to Setting up: 1. Lift off the top portion that holds the reservoir 2. Take off back cover and install 4 AA batteries(not included). (flashing light indicates it was done correctly) 3. Fill reservoir halfway with water, add liquid soap and swirl to dissolve. 4. Reattach the reservoir to the top of the unit and slide back into base. 5. Long press the button for 1 second on the top to turn on. 6. Place hand, brush, or sponge under dispenser until you hear the motor activate and the foam soap will dispense 7. To change the foam volume, press the top button and let go, the light will flash once for level one (0.6ml) and twice for level two (1.2ml) How to make the foam as beautiful & plentiful as bubbles? Just pour foam hand soap into the machine, mix it with water at the ratio of 1:4, wave and then it works! There isn't really a strict ratio to use, but 1:4 ratio is a good place to start and you can adjust from there based on your preference. All brands of hand wash can be filled in! Tip for regular wash liquid: it would be better to wave before using. Specifications: 1.Material: ABS Plastic 2.Reservoir: Food Grade PET Plastic 3.Capacity: 280ml 4.Input Power: 3 AA batteries (not included) 5.Foam Soap Volume: 2 levels (1s/2.5s) Package Includes: 1x Lantoo automatic foam soap dispenser 1x Funnel 1x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HCViaHrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lantoo","source_asin":"B01N20SGQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N20SGQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N20SGQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
