window.products.push({"id":393696,"name":"NapQueen 10 Inch Maxima Hybrid Mattress, King Size, Cooling Gel Infused Memory Foam and Innerspring Mattress, Bed in a Box, White & Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QKDj3EF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At NapQueen, everything is about improving your sleep quality and offering you outstanding comfort every time you lay down! We specialize in developing and providing a wide range of premium quality mattress that promise to redefine your sleeping patterns and comfort expectations, taking your bedtime experience to the next level! Our mattresses feature a combination of high-quality materials and innovative technologies to ensure maximum comfort and durability without compromising your safety! Not completely pleased with your order? Don’t worry, we are always at your service to address any issues or concerns. 10-inch Hybrid Mattress – Taking Comfort to a New Level Whether you want to improve your sleep quality or you want to always feel luxurious when you lay down to sleep, the NapQueen memory foam mattress is the right choice! Featuring an innovative hybrid design with memory foam, cooling-gel insertion and strong springs, this mattress provides medium firm and incredible comfort, adapting your body curves and ensuring excellent support! Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product: Available in 5 sizes: Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King; 10-inch thickness; Hybrid design with memory foam and spring box; cooling-gel insert for enhanced comfort and a cooling effect; Soft plush top fabric; Medium firmness; Fiberglass-free; Fire retardant cotton-based inner cover; Excellent support and cushioning; Superior comfort; Promotes correct sleeping position; May help improve sleep quality and patterns; Excellent choice for bedroom, student dorm, kids’ bedroom, RVs; You will love the luxurious comfort of our NapQueen mattress!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QKDj3EF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NapQueen","source_asin":"B0BRCZXSS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRCZXSS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRCZXSS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":393697,"name":"Kitchen Details Soft Grip 11\" Inch Silicone Spatula Turner Spatula/Slotted Spatula Non Stick,BPA Free Heat Resistant to 600°F Perfect for Fish, Eggs, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qoUHMbe2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kitchen Details Soft Grip 11\" Inch Silicone Spatula Turner doesn't bend too much like a lot of the rubber ones do, and it's just the right size (about 11 inches long) for a range of tasks from stirring a pot of rice to scooping the last remains of cake batter from the bowl. it perfectly shapes the eggs into the fluffy mass you crave. It's dishwasher-safe, but is also really easy to hand-wash, unlike a few other of the spatulas out there which will remain nameless. In short, it's sturdier than any other spatula you own, yet still giving the right amount of bend. Because of it's slotted shape, as a fish spatula you can work in a pinch if you're frying and don't have a slotted spoon or spatula. AND it's sturdy and sharp enough to scrape up whatever crusty bits that end up stuck to your cast-iron or non stick sheet pan. It will allow you to flip and remove a fillet from its cooking pan without tearing the flesh since it is designed to easily slip under delicate fillets of fish. Our mission is to bring you nothing short of perfection, to pass our passion and love from our kitchen to you and yours. Because we know how your heart goes into a dish and nothing but fun, easy to use kitchen tools will do. From measuring coffee to baking warm chocolate chip cookies our tool collection will be your trusted kitchen go-to's time and time again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qoUHMbe2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Details","source_asin":"B07XYHLLVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYHLLVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYHLLVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
