window.products.push({"id":393852,"name":"MAASTERS 2 Pcs Magazine Rack with Screwless Stick-On Mount - Black Metal Magazine Holder Rack - Stylish Bathroom And Waiting Area Reading Display Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811GPOKG19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE RANGE OF USES - We know you love reading in all of its forms so we made a wall mounted file holder that works as a slide-in storage for newspapers, mail, magazines, paper bags, and even cutting boards. Switch them out or mix and match for a varied library, our wall folder holder can handle it all in any room of the house. EFFORTLESS STICK-ON INSTALLATION - This stellar pair of racks comes with four translucent and powerful stickers for you to seamlessly mount each holder to. Simply peel the backside of the sticker off and firmly press it onto your desired surface before sliding the structure into place and tightening the nuts. Now you can install your bathroom magazine rack without damaging walls or tiles. STURDY WIRE CONSTRUCTION - Our expert manufacturers want you to have a modern newspaper or magazine holder that will keep your reading material organized for years to come. That’s why we craft with a tenaciously hardwearing wire that can handle constant use without scratching or losing its shape. CRAFT BOARD STICKERS INCLUDED - This magazine wall mount for waiting areas comes with six organizational stickers so you can keep your selection in line. Feel free to get creative as they have a blank section for you to label as you please. Stop wasting time rifling through pages to find what you’re looking for and choose the rack that helps you keep track. LIGHTWEIGHT AND RUST PROTECTED - Our holders for storing magazines in toilets are durable yet extremely minimal in their design so you can organize your stuff without a clunky solid shelf ruining the flow of your space. To ensure that each set of letter holder for wall will last you years to come, we powder coat the entire piece to protect it from rust or corrosion from cleaning chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811GPOKG19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAASTERS","source_asin":"B09MD572LW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-393852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD572LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD572LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
